  characterName: Django Manush
  promptText: I have just learned that my pension is invested in mines where children
    work underground. If I press the fund to divest, I lose my modest income. Do
    I keep my pension for security, or refuse to profit from their suffering?
  leftAnswer: Yes, keep the pension; your dignity and security in old age matter.
  rightAnswer: No, push to divest; no income is worth child labour.
